#. (itstool) path: simplesect/para
#: Ada_Zangemann.dbk:327
msgid ""
"A book that arouses interest in tinkering and encourages shaping technology."
msgstr ""
"En bok som väcker lust att experimentera och uppmuntrar läsaren att forma "
"tekniken."

#. (itstool) path: mediaobject/alt
#. The alt tag contains an alternative text, describing the image for the
#. visual impaired. priority:80
#: Ada_Zangemann.dbk:338
msgid ""
"A power strip, with input and output of white electrical cord that is the "
"frame."
msgstr ""
"Ett grenuttag med en vit elsladd som går in och ut och bildar ramen."

#. (itstool) path: para/phrase
#: Ada_Zangemann.dbk:878
msgid ""
"The evening before, they had put LED lights on some of the signs, which were "
"now flashing brightly. They had connected their speakers together so "
"everyone in the street could hear what they were saying."
msgstr ""
"Kvällen före hade de satt LED-lampor på några av skyltarna och nu lyste och "
"blinkade de starkt. De hade kopplat ihop sina högtalare så att alla på gatan "
"kunde höra vad de sa."
